e":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"そうですね一応vagrantは入れられるので最初は自分もそっちを考えてました","ts":"1622248582.116600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Dh0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"893cfff6-0f6c-479c-a1ec-647deaafaa21","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Proならvagrant + hyper-v の arch box なんていう選択肢も実はあったりして。\n\u003chttps://app.vagrantup.com/generic/boxes/arch\u003e","ts":"1622248535.115700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8tw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eaa0b7c5-cf6b-418b-b77e-90f6cf103212","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"とりあえずarchをインストできた","ts":"1622248453.115100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zES"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90423cd3-504b-4929-b842-3d5045f5f7a4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"yes","ts":"1622244805.114400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zo8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E5F48959-07E6-4565-B9AE-8B2B1B3E0E4F","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"thincaさん確も確かWSL2+archでしたよね","ts":"1622244774.114000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fUO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1564285d-2cd9-47eb-8cc2-f08978f83be8","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"一応、自前ビルドする際の参考情報も貼っておきますね。（System V IPCのバグは修正されたみたいです）\n\u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.jp/index.php/WSL_%E3%81%AB%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB\u003e","ts":"1622242742.113000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Im=S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0cf9db5-480f-480d-a2b6-cbc356a95e87","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ただし、サーバーが物凄く遠いので何らかのダウンローダーを噛ませないと一時間経っても終わらないですが。","ts":"1622241665.111900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PWn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8b56c8c-9d4d-4a6e-ad87-d8e3b45da176","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"実はUbuntuもストア版だけじゃなくて最新版イメージをこんなところで公開されてたりするんです。\n\u003chttps://cloud-images.ubuntu.com/releases/hirsute/release/\u003e","ts":"1622241598.110900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qv/x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8887535-dbd6-47f3-aba7-3d977d9be311","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"windowsを入れてみて思ったのは、やはり自分にはwindowsが辛いと言うこと","ts":"1622241516.109500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=OF+k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a06e371b-8e6d-4529-a055-978630666839","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"WSL2だったらrootfsイメージを用意すれば `wsl --import` コマンドで入れられますね。","ts":"1622241510.109400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX","U022J6JLQ3V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"esYPY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eb00933-9037-45fd-a87f-7f6086454d7b","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"私はこれ使ってますね\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuk7/ArchWSL\u003e","ts":"1622241443.107700","thread_ts":"1622241443.107700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: yuk7/ArchWSL","id":1,"title":"yuk7/ArchWSL","title_link":"https://github.com/yuk7/ArchWSL","text":"ArchLinux based WSL Distribution. Supports multiple install. - yuk7/ArchWSL","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/4bf6ac2b6e6da919ad837e82b94ce0fa88d609c77c333fdb0147d414d8ba806b/yuk7/ArchWSL","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/yuk7/ArchWSL","original_url":"https://github.com/yuk7/ArchWSL"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o0V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a9ab320-af5c-4196-8b8b-4f2774a1f62b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あぁそれは実行してます","ts":"1622241438.107500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NdcBE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6388727c-835d-4f99-9ee9-c12c900f5258","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"もちろん `wsl --set-default-version 2` を実行してからですが。","ts":"1622241426.106900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YXk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"269e0f2c-6d39-4842-80d0-c8b07ce23dcc","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"やっぱりそうですよね…archで立てたいんですけどwslないみたいなんですよね…","ts":"1622241401.106300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZBJKg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c89d0cab-582e-4739-be0c-98502c705a66","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"やっぱWSLじゃないですかね？","ts":"1622241351.105300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=n4Wq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af1f2350-7b7f-48b4-b851-f9cfd934431e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"今って、windowsでlinux環境つくるのなにがメジャーなんですかね\n自分はvagrantで作ろうかと思ってるんですけど","ts":"1622239857.104800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5XmH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"448e2632-0c75-4701-a212-218ace1fd435","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"やっぱりwindows少し使いづらいなぁ","ts":"1622239806.103800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O+g6o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4f93bb4-5eb0-4d4f-920d-a108d359d423","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"お! やってみようかな。ありがとうございます","ts":"1622241566.110100","thread_ts":"1622241443.107700","parent_user_id":"U8CC7MDCL","team":"T03